00:06:36.949 --> 00:06:38.280
And then here's the last one.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:41.889
This one is on Sonia Sotomayor, who
Speaker 4: has been very aggressive countering

00:06:41.889 --> 00:06:42.889
