00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:22.470
Yeah.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:28.551
Speaker 1: So, you know, again, it's not that
it's invalid to touch on these issues, but

00:07:28.551 --> 00:07:29.780
it's all meaningless.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:30.780
Gotcha.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:36.540
You're not really informing anyone by asking
